edby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-20T18:49:49-07:00","id":236038,"title":"","content":"A fuller version of the soliloquy, for the record:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&quot;O, that this </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">too too </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">solid</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> flesh would melt</span></span></span> / <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Thaw and resolve itself into a dew! /</span></span></span> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Or that the Everlasting had not fix'd / </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">His canon 'gainst self-slaughter!</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> O God! God! / </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">How weary, stale, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">flat</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> and unprofitable,</span></span></span> / <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Seem to me all the uses of this world!</span></span></span> / <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Fie on't! ah fie! 'tis an </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">unweeded garden</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">,</span></span></span> / <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">That grows to seed; things rank and gross </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">in nature / Possess it merely</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">. [\u2026] That it should come to this! / </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">But break, my heart</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">; for I must hold my tongue.&quot;</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 09-16-2014, 10:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-20T22:35:03-07:00","id":236198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Unahim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/19267-gmc-changeling?p=235771#post235771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's misquoted, the actual line there is &quot;this too too solid flesh&quot;. Yes, 2 times <i>too</i>. I can see why they would have perhaps intentionally misquoted it, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>MugaSofer has the misquote. It was just &quot;Too Solid Flesh&quot;.<br /> <br /> It's on page 3, post 33 of this very thread.<br /> <br /> And yeah. It's all kinds of perfect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-21T11:08:13-07:00","id":236706,"title":"","content":"I ask how to update Changeling to the rules revision, and i get an announced second edition of C:TL<br /> <br /> It's like onyx path came to me and said &quot;Here Wrequis, we'll figure it out for you&quot; &lt;3","signature":"","edited":{"use